release=1.21.0
tag=1.21.0
tag_description=
**Charts:**
**1. Updated ska-tmc-mid from v1.21.0-rc.3 to v1.21.0**
        * Support for Position Velocity Time pattern added.
        * ProgramTrackTable size is now configurable via ProgramTrackTableSize property in dish pointing device
        * Fixed skb-1314.
        * Fixed DLN not able to generate program track table continuously.
        * To work the EndScan command as expected provide scan duration greater than 50 seconds.


  
release_notes=
**Charts:**
**1. Updated ska-tmc-mid from v1.21.0-rc.3 to v1.21.0**
       * Support for Position Velocity Time pattern added.
        * ProgramTrackTable size is now configurable via ProgramTrackTableSize property in dish pointing device
        * Fixed skb-1314.
        * Fixed DLN not able to generate program track table continuously.
        * To work the EndScan command as expected provide scan duration greater than 50 seconds.